Package: pulsaros-global-menu
Version: 1.0.131
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Depends: gnome-shell, pamtester, gir1.2-gst-plugins-base-1.0, gir1.2-gstreamer-1.0
Description: Lightweight global menu extension for Pulsar OS.
 Provides Mac-like global application menus in the top bar.
 Fully compatible with GNOME 45-50 and Wayland.
